# Optional for local development. Never put a private key in this file.
# Copy to .env.local (which is gitignored) and paste only the single-line base64
# DER SubjectPublicKeyInfo body shown by Chrome Web Store's "View public key".
# Without it, an unpacked development build does not have the official stable ID.
CHROME_EXTENSION_PUBLIC_KEY=

# Optional guard for a local release-like build. It must match the ID derived
# from CHROME_EXTENSION_PUBLIC_KEY.
# CHROME_EXTENSION_EXPECTED_ID=iehgbogeakiedihodennfcnigojnncag

# Formal GitHub releases set this guard in release.yml and fail if the repository
# variable CHROME_EXTENSION_PUBLIC_KEY is missing or invalid.
# WEBPAGE_MCP_REQUIRE_EXTENSION_PUBLIC_KEY=true
